  title: "Surgical Aortic Valve Replacement",
  subtitle: "Cutting out a diseased aortic valve and sewing in a new one — root anatomy, the conduction axis you must not stitch through, stenosis versus regurgitation, and root enlargement for the annulus that is too small.",
  readMins: 45,
